   "metadata": {
    "id": "oj5Tf8ShXsJH"
   },
   "source": [
    "Visualisation 1: Global Average Temperature Trend Over Time"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
     "height": 417
    },
    "collapsed": true,
    "id": "L_a1mYP38Hqn",
    "outputId": "48f65770-4021-4080-e873-6b663d2f4bf0"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1200x500 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Compute mean for numeric columns\n",
    "numeric_cols = ['AverageTemperature', 'AverageTemperatureUncertainty']\n",
    "df_yearly = temp_by_city[numeric_cols + ['dt']].resample('YE', on='dt').mean()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Plot yearly average temperature with uncertainty\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(12,5))\n",
    "plt.plot(df_yearly.index, df_yearly['AverageTemperature'], color='red', label='Global Avg Temp')\n",
    "plt.fill_between(\n",
    "    df_yearly.index,\n",
    "    df_yearly['AverageTemperature'] - df_yearly['AverageTemperatureUncertainty'],\n",
    "    df_yearly['AverageTemperature'] + df_yearly['AverageTemperatureUncertainty'],\n",
    "    color='red', alpha=0.2, label='Uncertainty'\n",
    ")\n",
    "plt.xlabel('Year')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Temperature (°C)')\n",
    "plt.title('Average Temperature Across All Cities (with Uncertainty)')\n",
    "plt.legend()\n",
    "plt.grid(True)\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "eHu6_aEcXxtU"
   },
   "source": [
    "This visualisation reveals a clear upward trend in global average temperatures, particularly pronounced from the mid-20th century onwards, coinciding with increased industrial activity and greenhouse gas emissions."
   ]
  },
  {
