    "We can see amount of missing data of CH4, N2O, and CO2, which must be taken into account when performing our analysis. We can also see that there are some missing data for other gases as well, but they are not as significant as the 3 main greenhouse gases, so we can consider using them in our analysis if we can find ways to work with the data (e.g replacement of NULL values). However, if we cannot find ways to work with the data, then we will consider dropping them from our analysis."
