  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The dataset above was downloaded on the 18th March 2026, from OurWorldInData. It has data spanning from 1880 to 2020. It shows the progression of the global mean sea level in relation to the 1993-2008 average data. The data was collected from Church and White (2011) and UHSLC and then the average of both is taken. The data seems to be taken every 3 months on the 15th of each month. The sea level is measured in mm. This dataset is meant to be an additional dataset to help with our main datasets analysis, to provide us with more information that can possibly help us answer our problem statement better."
   ]
  },
  {
