   "source": [
    "from above, more than 60% of the UHSLC column is NULL, while around 10% of the Chruch and White column is NULL. The average values of both columns are taken to have a better estimate of the sea level. We might be able to use the Average column as our main data since there is no NULL values, but we will have to do further checks (differences between the 2 data columns - Church and White, UHSLC) before concluding this."
