  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We then fill the missing (country, year) combinations with NaN values, which will be imputed in the next step. "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 99,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Number of unique countries: 159\n",
      "Number of unique years: 164\n",
      "Expected (country, year) combinations: 26076\n",
      "Actual (country, year) combinations:   26076\n",
